{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_191af7ea080249409233383e","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t// Board.js — 8x8 grid state management\n2\tconst TILE_COLORS = 6;\n3\tconst BOARD_SIZE = 8;\n4\tconst EMPTY = -1;\n5\t\n6\tconst COLOR_MAP = {\n7\t  0: { name: 'apple',   hex: '#FF4D4D', label: '红' },\n8\t  1: { name: 'banana',  hex: '#FFD93D', label: '黄' },\n9\t  2: { name: 'blueberry', hex: '#4DA6FF', label: '蓝' },\n10\t  3: { name: 'lime',    hex: '#6BCB77', label: '绿' },\n11\t  4: { name: 'grape',   hex: '#B47AEA', label: '紫' },\n12\t  5: { name: 'orange',  hex: '#FF9A3C', label: '橙' },\n13\t};\n14\t\n15\t// Special tile types\n16\tconst SPECIAL_NONE = 0;\n17\tconst SPECIAL_STRIPED_H = 1;  // horizontal stripe bomb\n18\tconst SPECIAL_STRIPED_V = 2;  // vertical stripe bomb\n19\tconst SPECIAL_BOMB = 3;       // 3x3 area bomb\n20\tconst SPECIAL_RAINBOW = 4;    // clears all of one color\n21\t\n22\tclass Tile {\n23\t  constructor(color, row, col) {\n24\t    this.color = color;\n25\t    this.row = row;\n26\t    this.col = col;\n27\t    this.special = SPECIAL_NONE;\n28\t    this.removing = false;\n29\t    this.offsetY = 0;\n30\t    this.offsetX = 0;\n31\t    this.scale = 1;\n32\t    this.alpha = 1;\n33\t    this.selected = false;\n34\t    this.id = Tile._nextId++;\n35\t  }\n36\t  get type() { return this.color; }\n37\t}\n38\t\n39\tTile._nextId = 0;\n40\t\n41\tclass Board {\n42\t  constructor(size = BOARD_SIZE, numColors = TILE_COLORS) {\n43\t    this.size = size;\n44\t    this.numColors = numColors;\n45\t    this.grid = [];\n46\t    this.listeners = [];\n47\t  }\n48\t\n49\t  init() {\n50\t    this.grid = [];\n51\t    for (let r = 0; r < this.size; r++) {\n52\t      this.grid[r] = [];\n53\t      for (let c = 0; c < this.size; c++) {\n54\t        this.grid[r][c] = this._createTile(r, c);\n55\t      }\n56\t    }\n57\t    // Ensure no initial matches\n58\t    this._removeInitialMatches();\n59\t  }\n60\t\n61\t  _createTile(row, col) {\n62\t    return new Tile(this._randomColor(), row, col);\n63\t  }\n64\t\n65\t  _randomColor() {\n66\t    return Math.floor(Math.random() * this.numColors);\n67\t  }\n68\t\n69\t  _removeInitialMatches() {\n70\t    let maxIter = 1000;\n71\t    while (this._hasMatch() && maxIter-- > 0) {\n72\t      const matches = this.findAllMatches();\n73\t      for (const group of matches) {\n74\t        for (const { row, col } of group.cells) {\n75\t          this.grid[row][col] = this._createTile(row, col);\n76\t        }\n77\t      }\n78\t    }\n79\t  }\n80\t\n81\t  _hasMatch() {\n82\t    return this.findAllMatches().length > 0;\n83\t  }\n84\t\n85\t  getTile(r, c) {\n86\t    if (r < 0 || r >= this.size || c < 0 || c >= this.size) return null;\n87\t    return this.grid[r][c];\n88\t  }\n89\t\n90\t  setTile(r, c, tile) {\n91\t    if (r >= 0 && r < this.size && c >= 0 && c < this.size) {\n92\t      tile.row = r;\n93\t      tile.col = c;\n94\t      this.grid[r][c] = tile;\n95\t    }\n96\t  }\n97\t\n98\t  swap(r1, c1, r2, c2) {\n99\t    const a = this.grid[r1][c1];\n100\t    const b = this.grid[r2][c2];\n101\t    this.grid[r1][c1] = b;\n102\t    this.grid[r2][c2] = a;\n103\t    if (a) { a.row = r2; a.col = c2; }\n104\t    if (b) { b.row = r1; b.col = c1; }\n105\t  }\n106\t\n107\t  removeTile(r, c) {\n108\t    const tile = this.grid[r][c];\n109\t    if (tile) tile.removing = true;\n110\t    return tile;\n111\t  }\n112\t\n113\t  clearCell(r, c) {\n114\t    this.grid[r][c] = null;\n115\t  }\n116\t\n117\t  isValid(r, c) {\n118\t    return r >= 0 && r < this.size && c >= 0 && c < this.size;\n119\t  }\n120\t\n121\t  isAdjacent(r1, c1, r2, c2) {\n122\t    const dr = Math.abs(r1 - r2);\n123\t    const dc = Math.abs(c1 - c2);\n124\t    return (dr + dc) === 1;\n125\t  }\n126\t\n127\t  // Find all horizontal and vertical matches of length >= 3\n128\t  findAllMatches() {\n129\t    const matches = [];\n130\t\n131\t    // Horizontal scan\n132\t    for (let r = 0; r < this.size; r++) {\n133\t      let start = 0;\n134\t      for (let c = 1; c <= this.size; c++) {\n135\t        const cur = c < this.size ? this.grid[r][c] : null;\n136\t        const prev = this.grid[r][start];\n137\t        if (c < this.size && cur && prev && cur.color === prev.color && cur.color !== EMPTY) {\n138\t          continue;\n139\t        }\n140\t        const len = c - start;\n141\t        if (len >= 3 && prev && prev.color !== EMPTY) {\n142\t          const cells = [];\n143\t          for (let k = start; k < c; k++) cells.push({ row: r, col: k });\n144\t          matches.push({ cells, length: len, direction: 'horizontal', color: prev.color });\n145\t        }\n146\t        start = c;\n147\t      }\n148\t    }\n149\t\n150\t    // Vertical scan\n151\t    for (let c = 0; c < this.size; c++) {\n152\t      let start = 0;\n153\t      for (let r = 1; r <= this.size; r++) {\n154\t        const cur = r < this.size ? this.grid[r][c] : null;\n155\t        const prev = this.grid[start][c];\n156\t        if (r < this.size && cur && prev && cur.color === prev.color && cur.color !== EMPTY) {\n157\t          continue;\n158\t        }\n159\t        const len = r - start;\n160\t        if (len >= 3 && prev && prev.color !== EMPTY) {\n161\t          const cells = [];\n162\t          for (let k = start; k < r; k++) cells.push({ row: k, col: c });\n163\t          matches.push({ cells, length: len, direction: 'vertical', color: prev.color });\n164\t        }\n165\t        start = r;\n166\t      }\n167\t    }\n168\t\n169\t    return matches;\n170\t  }\n171\t\n172\t  // Detect L/T shape matches by finding intersections of horizontal and vertical matches\n173\t  findLShapeMatches(matches) {\n174\t    const lShapes = [];\n175\t    for (let i = 0; i < matches.length; i++) {\n176\t      for (let j = i + 1; j < matches.length; j++) {\n177\t        const a = matches[i], b = matches[j];\n178\t        if (a.direction === b.direction) continue;\n179\t        if (a.color !== b.color) continue;\n180\t        // Find intersection\n181\t        const setA = new Set(a.cells.map(c => `${c.row},${c.col}`));\n182\t        for (const cell of b.cells) {\n183\t          if (setA.has(`${cell.row},${cell.col}`)) {\n184\t            // L/T shape found — merge all cells\n185\t            const allCellsMap = {};\n186\t            for (const c of a.cells) allCellsMap[`${c.row},${c.col}`] = c;\n187\t            for (const c of b.cells) allCellsMap[`${c.row},${c.col}`] = c;\n188\t            const allCells = Object.values(allCellsMap);\n189\t            lShapes.push({ cells: allCells, color: a.color });\n190\t          }\n191\t        }\n192\t      }\n193\t    }\n194\t    return lShapes;\n195\t  }\n196\t\n197\t  // Apply gravity: move tiles down to fill empty cells\n198\t  applyGravity() {\n199\t    const drops = [];\n200\t    for (let c = 0; c < this.size; c++) {\n201\t      let writeRow = this.size - 1;\n202\t      for (let r = this.size - 1; r >= 0; r--) {\n203\t        if (this.grid[r][c] !== null) {\n204\t          if (r !== writeRow) {\n205\t            const tile = this.grid[r][c];\n206\t            const fromRow = r;\n207\t            this.grid[r][c] = null;\n208\t            this.grid[writeRow][c] = tile;\n209\t            const distance = writeRow - fromRow;\n210\t            tile.row = writeRow;\n211\t            drops.push({ tile, fromRow, toRow: writeRow, col: c, distance });\n212\t          }\n213\t          writeRow--;\n214\t        }\n215\t      }\n216\t      // Fill empty top cells\n217\t      for (let r = writeRow; r >= 0; r--) {\n218\t        const tile = this._createTile(r, c);\n219\t        tile.offsetY = -(writeRow - r + 1); // start above board\n220\t        this.grid[r][c] = tile;\n221\t        drops.push({ tile, fromRow: -(writeRow - r + 1), toRow: r, col: c, distance: r + (writeRow - r + 1) });\n222\t      }\n223\t    }\n224\t    return drops;\n225\t  }\n226\t\n227\t  // Check if any valid move exists (for deadlock detection)\n228\t  // obstacleMgr is optional — if provided, skip chained/blocked cells\n229\t  hasValidMoves(obstacleMgr) {\n230\t    for (let r = 0; r < this.size; r++) {\n231\t      for (let c = 0; c < this.size; c++) {\n232\t        if (!this.grid[r][c]) continue;\n233\t        // Skip if tile is chained or cell is blocked\n234\t        if (obstacleMgr) {\n235\t          if (obstacleMgr.isCellBlocked(r, c)) continue;\n236\t          if (!obstacleMgr.canSwap(r, c)) continue;\n237\t        }\n238\t        // Try swap right\n239\t        if (c + 1 < this.size && this.grid[r][c + 1]) {\n240\t          if (obstacleMgr && !obstacleMgr.canSwap(r, c + 1)) continue;\n241\t          this.swap(r, c, r, c + 1);\n242\t          const has = this.findAllMatches().length > 0;\n243\t          this.swap(r, c, r, c + 1);\n244\t          if (has) return true;\n245\t        }\n246\t        // Try swap down\n247\t        if (r + 1 < this.size && this.grid[r + 1][c]) {\n248\t          if (obstacleMgr && !obstacleMgr.canSwap(r + 1, c)) continue;\n249\t          this.swap(r, c, r + 1, c);\n250\t          const has = this.findAllMatches().length > 0;\n251\t          this.swap(r, c, r + 1, c);\n252\t          if (has) return true;\n253\t        }\n254\t      }\n255\t    }\n256\t    return false;\n257\t  }\n258\t\n259\t  // Shuffle board if no valid moves\n260\t  shuffle() {\n261\t    const tiles = [];\n262\t    for (let r = 0; r < this.size; r++) {\n263\t      for (let c = 0; c < this.size; c++) {\n264\t        tiles.push(this.grid[r][c].color);\n265\t      }\n266\t    }\n267\t    // Fisher-Yates shuffle\n268\t    for (let i = tiles.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {\n269\t      const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));\n270\t      [tiles[i], tiles[j]] = [tiles[j], tiles[i]];\n271\t    }\n272\t    let idx = 0;\n273\t    for (let r = 0; r < this.size; r++) {\n274\t      for (let c = 0; c < this.size; c++) {\n275\t        this.grid[r][c].color = tiles[idx++];\n276\t      }\n277\t    }\n278\t    // Remove any initial matches from shuffle\n279\t    this._removeInitialMatches();\n280\t    // If still no valid moves, re-init\n281\t    if (!this.hasValidMoves()) {\n282\t      this.init();\n283\t    }\n284\t  }\n285\t}\n286\t\n287\tif (typeof module !== 'undefined') module.exports = { Board, Tile, BOARD_SIZE, TILE_COLORS, SPECIAL_NONE, SPECIAL_STRIPED_H, SPECIAL_STRIPED_V, SPECIAL_BOMB, SPECIAL_RAINBOW, COLOR_MAP };\n288\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"efc4c585-24c5-4fd5-bbba-79c262b1755c","uuid":"9b05786d-c436-46cc-b47a-088774eb5093","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:32:21.777Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\game-projects\\douyin-match3\\src\\js\\Board.js","content":"// Board.js — 8x8 grid state management\nconst TILE_COLORS = 6;\nconst BOARD_SIZE = 8;\nconst EMPTY = -1;\n\nconst COLOR_MAP = {\n  0: { name: 'apple',   hex: '#FF4D4D', label: '红' },\n  1: { name: 'banana',  hex: '#FFD93D', label: '黄' },\n  2: { name: 'blueberry', hex: '#4DA6FF', label: '蓝' },\n  3: { name: 'lime',    hex: '#6BCB77', label: '绿' },\n  4: { name: 'grape',   hex: '#B47AEA', label: '紫' },\n  5: { name: 'orange',  hex: '#FF9A3C', label: '橙' },\n};\n\n// Special tile types\nconst SPECIAL_NONE = 0;\nconst SPECIAL_STRIPED_H = 1;  // horizontal stripe bomb\nconst SPECIAL_STRIPED_V = 2;  // vertical stripe bomb\nconst SPECIAL_BOMB = 3;       // 3x3 area bomb\nconst SPECIAL_RAINBOW = 4;    // clears all of one color\n\nclass Tile {\n  constructor(color, row, col) {\n    this.color = color;\n    this.row = row;\n    this.col = col;\n    this.special = SPECIAL_NONE;\n    this.removing = false;\n    this.offsetY = 0;\n    this.offsetX = 0;\n    this.scale = 1;\n    this.alpha = 1;\n    this.selected = false;\n    this.id = Tile._nextId++;\n  }\n  get type() { return this.color; }\n}\n\nTile._nextId = 0;\n\nclass Board {\n  constructor(size = BOARD_SIZE, numColors = TILE_COLORS) {\n    this.size = size;\n    this.numColors = numColors;\n    this.grid = [];\n    this.listeners = [];\n  }\n\n  init() {\n    this.grid = [];\n    for (let r = 0; r < this.size; r++) {\n      this.grid[r] = [];\n      for (let c = 0; c < this.size; c++) {\n        this.grid[r][c] = this._createTile(r, c);\n      }\n    }\n    // Ensure no initial matches\n    this._removeInitialMatches();\n  }\n\n  _createTile(row, col) {\n    return new Tile(this._randomColor(), row, col);\n  }\n\n  _randomColor() {\n    return Math.floor(Math.random() * this.numColors);\n  }\n\n  _removeInitialMatches() {\n    let maxIter = 1000;\n    while (this._hasMatch() && maxIter-- > 0) {\n      const matches = this.findAllMatches();\n      for (const group of matches) {\n        for (const { row, col } of group.cells) {\n          this.grid[row][col] = this._createTile(row, col);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  _hasMatch() {\n    return this.findAllMatches().length > 0;\n  }\n\n  getTile(r, c) {\n    if (r < 0 || r >= this.size || c < 0 || c >= this.size) return null;\n    return this.grid[r][c];\n  }\n\n  setTile(r, c, tile) {\n    if (r >= 0 && r < this.size && c >= 0 && c < this.size) {\n      tile.row = r;\n      tile.col = c;\n      this.grid[r][c] = tile;\n    }\n  }\n\n  swap(r1, c1, r2, c2) {\n    const a = this.grid[r1][c1];\n    const b = this.grid[r2][c2];\n    this.grid[r1][c1] = b;\n    this.grid[r2][c2] = a;\n    if (a) { a.row = r2; a.col = c2; }\n    if (b) { b.row = r1; b.col = c1; }\n  }\n\n  removeTile(r, c) {\n    const tile = this.grid[r][c];\n    if (tile) tile.removing = true;\n    return tile;\n  }\n\n  clearCell(r, c) {\n    this.grid[r][c] = null;\n  }\n\n  isValid(r, c) {\n    return r >= 0 && r < this.size && c >= 0 && c < this.size;\n  }\n\n  isAdjacent(r1, c1, r2, c2) {\n    const dr = Math.abs(r1 - r2);\n    const dc = Math.abs(c1 - c2);\n    return (dr + dc) === 1;\n  }\n\n  // Find all horizontal and vertical matches of length >= 3\n  findAllMatches() {\n    const matches = [];\n\n    // Horizontal scan\n    for (let r = 0; r < this.size; r++) {\n      let start = 0;\n      for (let c = 1; c <= this.size; c++) {\n        const cur = c < this.size ? this.grid[r][c] : null;\n        const prev = this.grid[r][start];\n        if (c < this.size && cur && prev && cur.color === prev.color && cur.color !== EMPTY) {\n          continue;\n        }\n        const len = c - start;\n        if (len >= 3 && prev && prev.color !== EMPTY) {\n          const cells = [];\n          for (let k = start; k < c; k++) cells.push({ row: r, col: k });\n          matches.push({ cells, length: len, direction: 'horizontal', color: prev.color });\n        }\n        start = c;\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Vertical scan\n    for (let c = 0; c < this.size; c++) {\n      let start = 0;\n      for (let r = 1; r <= this.size; r++) {\n        const cur = r < this.size ? this.grid[r][c] : null;\n        const prev = this.grid[start][c];\n        if (r < this.size && cur && prev && cur.color === prev.color && cur.color !== EMPTY) {\n          continue;\n        }\n        const len = r - start;\n        if (len >= 3 && prev && prev.color !== EMPTY) {\n          const cells = [];\n          for (let k = start; k < r; k++) cells.push({ row: k, col: c });\n          matches.push({ cells, length: len, direction: 'vertical', color: prev.color });\n        }\n        start = r;\n      }\n    }\n\n    return matches;\n  }\n\n  // Detect L/T shape matches by finding intersections of horizontal and vertical matches\n  findLShapeMatches(matches) {\n    const lShapes = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < matches.length; i++) {\n      for (let j = i + 1; j < matches.length; j++) {\n        const a = matches[i], b = matches[j];\n        if (a.direction === b.direction) continue;\n        if (a.color !== b.color) continue;\n        // Find intersection\n        const setA = new Set(a.cells.map(c => `${c.row},${c.col}`));\n        for (const cell of b.cells) {\n          if (setA.has(`${cell.row},${cell.col}`)) {\n            // L/T shape found — merge all cells\n            const allCellsMap = {};\n            for (const c of a.cells) allCellsMap[`${c.row},${c.col}`] = c;\n            for (const c of b.cells) allCellsMap[`${c.row},${c.col}`] = c;\n            const allCells = Object.values(allCellsMap);\n            lShapes.push({ cells: allCells, color: a.color });\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    return lShapes;\n  }\n\n  // Apply gravity: move tiles down to fill empty cells\n  applyGravity() {\n    const drops = [];\n    for (let c = 0; c < this.size; c++) {\n      let writeRow = this.size - 1;\n      for (let r = this.size - 1; r >= 0; r--) {\n        if (this.grid[r][c] !== null) {\n          if (r !== writeRow) {\n            const tile = this.grid[r][c];\n            const fromRow = r;\n            this.grid[r][c] = null;\n            this.grid[writeRow][c] = tile;\n            const distance = writeRow - fromRow;\n            tile.row = writeRow;\n            drops.push({ tile, fromRow, toRow: writeRow, col: c, distance });\n          }\n          writeRow--;\n        }\n      }\n      // Fill empty top cells\n      for (let r = writeRow; r >= 0; r--) {\n        const tile = this._createTile(r, c);\n        tile.offsetY = -(writeRow - r + 1); // start above board\n        this.grid[r][c] = tile;\n        drops.push({ tile, fromRow: -(writeRow - r + 1), toRow: r, col: c, distance: r + (writeRow - r + 1) });\n      }\n    }\n    return drops;\n  }\n\n  // Check if any valid move exists (for deadlock detection)\n  // obstacleMgr is optional — if provided, skip chained/blocked cells\n  hasValidMoves(obstacleMgr) {\n    for (let r = 0; r < this.size; r++) {\n      for (let c = 0; c < this.size; c++) {\n        if (!this.grid[r][c]) continue;\n        // Skip if tile is chained or cell is blocked\n        if (obstacleMgr) {\n          if (obstacleMgr.isCellBlocked(r, c)) continue;\n          if (!obstacleMgr.canSwap(r, c)) continue;\n        }\n        // Try swap right\n        if (c + 1 < this.size && this.grid[r][c + 1]) {\n          if (obstacleMgr && !obstacleMgr.canSwap(r, c + 1)) continue;\n          this.swap(r, c, r, c + 1);\n          const has = this.findAllMatches().length > 0;\n          this.swap(r, c, r, c + 1);\n          if (has) return true;\n        }\n        // Try swap down\n        if (r + 1 < this.size && this.grid[r + 1][c]) {\n          if (obstacleMgr && !obstacleMgr.canSwap(r + 1, c)) continue;\n          this.swap(r, c, r + 1, c);\n          const has = this.findAllMatches().length > 0;\n          this.swap(r, c, r + 1, c);\n          if (has) return true;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    return false;\n  }\n\n  // Shuffle board if no valid moves\n  shuffle() {\n    const tiles = [];\n    for (let r = 0; r < this.size; r++) {\n      for (let c = 0; c < this.size; c++) {\n        tiles.push(this.grid[r][c].color);\n      }\n    }\n    // Fisher-Yates shuffle\n    for (let i = tiles.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {\n      const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));\n      [tiles[i], tiles[j]] = [tiles[j], tiles[i]];\n    }\n    let idx = 0;\n    for (let r = 0; r < this.size; r++) {\n      for (let c = 0; c < this.size; c++) {\n        this.grid[r][c].color = tiles[idx++];\n      }\n    }\n    // Remove any initial matches from shuffle\n    this._removeInitialMatches();\n    // If still no valid moves, re-init\n    if (!this.hasValidMoves()) {\n      this.init();\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nif (typeof module !== 'undefined') module.exports = { Board, Tile, BOARD_SIZE, TILE_COLORS, SPECIAL_NONE, SPECIAL_STRIPED_H, SPECIAL_STRIPED_V, SPECIAL_BOMB, SPECIAL_RAINBOW, COLOR_MAP };\n","numLines":288,"startLine":1,"totalLines":288}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_4991ff0850db4fb3b3291d2c","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t// DailySystem.js — Daily login rewards, daily tasks, daily challenge\n2\t\n3\tclass DailySystem {\n4\t  constructor(dataManager, coinSystem) {\n5\t    this.dm = dataManager;\n6\t    this.cs = coinSystem;\n7\t    this.LOGIN_REWARDS = [10, 20, 40, 80, 150, 300, 500];\n8\t    this.TASK_TEMPLATES = [\n9\t      { id: 'clear_ice', name: '消除冰块达人', desc: '消除 {n} 个冰块', type: 'clear_obstacle', subType: 1, targets: [5, 8, 10] },\n10\t      { id: 'clear_chain', name: '破链专家', desc: '消除 {n} 个锁链', type: 'clear_obstacle', subType: 2, targets: [4, 6, 8] },\n11\t      { id: 'score_high', name: '高分挑战', desc: '单局获得 {n} 分', type: 'score', targets: [2000, 3000, 4000] },\n12\t      { id: 'chain_3', name: '连锁之王', desc: '达成 {n} 次连锁', type: 'chain', targets: [3, 5, 8] },\n13\t      { id: 'play_levels', name: '闯关达人', desc: '完成 {n} 关', type: 'complete_levels', targets: [2, 3, 5] },\n14\t      { id: 'star_3', name: '完美三星', desc: '获得 {n} 次三星', type: 'star3', targets: [1, 2, 3] },\n15\t      { id: 'use_special', name: '特效大师', desc: '使用 {n} 次特殊方块', type: 'special', targets: [3, 5, 8] },\n16\t      { id: 'collect_color', name: '色彩收集者', desc: '收集 {n} 个同色方块', type: 'collect_single', targets: [20, 30, 40] },\n17\t    ];\n18\t    this._initDaily();\n19\t  }\n20\t\n21\t  _initDaily() {\n22\t    if (!this.dm.data.daily) {\n23\t      this.dm.data.daily = {\n24\t        loginDay: 0,\n25\t        lastLoginDate: null,\n26\t        todayClaimed: false,\n27\t        tasks: [],\n28\t        challengeLevel: -1,\n29\t        challengeCompleted: false,\n30\t        taskProgress: {},\n31\t        weekStart: null,\n32\t      };\n33\t      this.dm.save();\n34\t    }\n35\t    this.daily = this.dm.data.daily;\n36\t  }\n37\t\n38\t  _todayStr() {\n39\t    return new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n40\t  }\n41\t\n42\t  _isSameDay(d1, d2) {\n43\t    if (!d1 || !d2) return false;\n44\t    return d1.slice(0, 10) === d2.slice(0, 10);\n45\t  }\n46\t\n47\t  checkNewDay() {\n48\t    const today = this._todayStr();\n49\t    if (!this._isSameDay(this.daily.lastLoginDate, today)) {\n50\t      const lastDate = this.daily.lastLoginDate ? new Date(this.daily.lastLoginDate) : null;\n51\t      const todayDate = new Date(today);\n52\t      const diffDays = lastDate ? Math.floor((todayDate - lastDate) / 86400000) : 99;\n53\t\n54\t      if (diffDays === 1) {\n55\t        this.daily.loginDay = Math.min(this.daily.loginDay + 1, 6);\n56\t      } else if (diffDays > 1) {\n57\t        this.daily.loginDay = 0;\n58\t      }\n59\t\n60\t      this.daily.todayClaimed = false;\n61\t      this.daily.lastLoginDate = today;\n62\t      this.daily.challengeCompleted = false;\n63\t      this._generateTasks();\n64\t      this._generateChallenge();\n65\t      this.dm.save();\n66\t    }\n67\t  }\n68\t\n69\t  claimLoginReward() {\n70\t    if (this.daily.todayClaimed) return 0;\n71\t    this.daily.todayClaimed = true;\n72\t    const reward = this.LOGIN_REWARDS[this.daily.loginDay] || 10;\n73\t    this.dm.addCoins(reward);\n74\t    this.dm.save();\n75\t    return reward;\n76\t  }\n77\t\n78\t  getLoginDay() { return this.daily.loginDay; }\n79\t  getLoginReward() { return this.LOGIN_REWARDS[this.daily.loginDay] || 10; }\n80\t  isLoginClaimed() { return this.daily.todayClaimed; }\n81\t\n82\t  _generateTasks() {\n83\t    const shuffled = [...this.TASK_TEMPLATES].sort(() => Math.random() - 0.5);\n84\t    const selected = shuffled.slice(0, 3);\n85\t    this.daily.tasks = selected.map((t, i) => {\n86\t      const diff = Math.min(i, t.targets.length - 1);\n87\t      return {\n88\t        id: t.id + '_' + i,\n89\t        templateId: t.id,\n90\t        name: t.name,\n91\t        desc: t.desc.replace('{n}', t.targets[diff]),\n92\t        type: t.type,\n93\t        subType: t.subType || 0,\n94\t        target: t.targets[diff],\n95\t        reward: [20, 50, 100][i],\n96\t        progress: 0,\n97\t        completed: false,\n98\t        claimed: false,\n99\t      };\n100\t    });\n101\t    this.daily.taskProgress = {};\n102\t    this.dm.save();\n103\t  }\n104\t\n105\t  getTasks() { return this.daily.tasks || []; }\n106\t\n107\t  reportEvent(eventType, value) {\n108\t    for (const task of this.daily.tasks) {\n109\t      if (task.completed) continue;\n110\t      if (task.type === eventType) {\n111\t        task.progress = Math.min(task.progress + (value || 1), task.target);\n112\t        if (task.progress >= task.target) task.completed = true;\n113\t      }\n114\t      if (task.type === 'clear_obstacle' && eventType === 'clear_obstacle') {\n115\t        if (task.subType === 0 || task.subType === value) {\n116\t          task.progress = Math.min(task.progress + 1, task.target);\n117\t          if (task.progress >= task.target) task.completed = true;\n118\t        }\n119\t      }\n120\t    }\n121\t    this.dm.save();\n122\t  }\n123\t\n124\t  claimTaskReward(taskId) {\n125\t    const task = this.daily.tasks.find(t => t.id === taskId);\n126\t    if (!task || !task.completed || task.claimed) return 0;\n127\t    task.claimed = true;\n128\t    this.dm.addCoins(task.reward);\n129\t    this.dm.save();\n130\t    return task.reward;\n131\t  }\n132\t\n133\t  _generateChallenge() {\n134\t    const dayOfWeek = new Date().getDay();\n135\t    const seed = Math.floor(Date.now() / 86400000);\n136\t    const levelPool = [];\n137\t    for (let i = 5; i < 50; i++) levelPool.push(i);\n138\t    const idx = (seed * 7 + dayOfWeek * 13) % levelPool.length;\n139\t    this.daily.challengeLevel = levelPool[idx];\n140\t    this.daily.challengeCompleted = false;\n141\t    this.dm.save();\n142\t  }\n143\t\n144\t  getChallengeLevel() { return this.daily.challengeLevel; }\n145\t  isChallengeDone() { return this.daily.challengeCompleted; }\n146\t  completeChallenge() {\n147\t    if (this.daily.challengeCompleted) return 0;\n148\t    this.daily.challengeCompleted = true;\n149\t    this.dm.addCoins(50);\n150\t    this.dm.save();\n151\t    return 50;\n152\t  }\n153\t\n154\t  render(ctx, screenW, screenH) {\n155\t    this.checkNewDay();\n156\t    const grad = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, 0, 0, screenH);\n157\t    grad.addColorStop(0, '#FFF8E7');\n158\t    grad.addColorStop(0.5, '#E8F5E9');\n159\t    grad.addColorStop(1, '#E3F2FD');\n160\t    ctx.fillStyle = grad;\n161\t    ctx.fillRect(0, 0, screenW, screenH);\n162\t\n163\t    // Title bar\n164\t    ctx.fillStyle = '#FF9A3C';\n165\t    this._roundRect(ctx, 10, 8, screenW - 20, 48, 12);\n166\t    ctx.fill();\n167\t    ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n168\t    ctx.font = 'bold 20px sans-serif';\n169\t    ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n170\t    ctx.fillText('📅 每日任务', screenW / 2, 40);\n171\t\n172\t    // Login reward section\n173\t    const loginY = 70;\n174\t    ctx.fillStyle = '#5D4037';\n175\t    ctx.font = 'bold 16px sans-serif';\n176\t    ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n177\t    ctx.fillText(`连续登录第 ${this.daily.loginDay + 1} 天`, screenW / 2, loginY);\n178\t\n179\t    // 7-day login boxes\n180\t    const boxSize = Math.min(40, (screenW - 60) / 7);\n181\t    const boxStartX = (screenW - boxSize * 7 - 6 * 4) / 2;\n182\t    for (let i = 0; i < 7; i++) {\n183\t      const bx = boxStartX + i * (boxSize + 4);\n184\t      const by = loginY + 10;\n185\t      const isCurrent = i === this.daily.loginDay;\n186\t      const isPast = i < this.daily.loginDay;\n187\t\n188\t      ctx.fillStyle = isCurrent ? '#FFB800' : isPast ? '#6BCB77' : '#E8E0D8';\n189\t      this._roundRect(ctx, bx, by, boxSize, boxSize + 8, 6);\n190\t      ctx.fill();\n191\t\n192\t      ctx.fillStyle = isPast || isCurrent ? '#FFF' : '#A09888';\n193\t      ctx.font = 'bold 11px sans-serif';\n194\t      ctx.fillText(`D${i + 1}`, bx + boxSize / 2, by + 14);\n195\t      ctx.font = '10px sans-serif';\n196\t      ctx.fillText(`${this.LOGIN_REWARDS[i]}🪙`, bx + boxSize / 2, by + 30);\n197\t\n198\t      if (isCurrent && !this.daily.todayClaimed) {\n199\t        ctx.fillStyle = '#FF4D4D';\n200\t        ctx.font = 'bold 10px sans-serif';\n201\t        ctx.fillText('领取', bx + boxSize / 2, by + boxSize + 2);\n202\t      }\n203\t    }\n204\t\n205\t    // Claim button\n206\t    const claimBtnY = loginY + boxSize + 30;\n207\t    if (!this.daily.todayClaimed) {\n208\t      const pulse = 1 + Math.sin(Date.now() / 300) * 0.05;\n209\t      ctx.save();\n210\t      ctx.translate(screenW / 2, claimBtnY + 16);\n211\t      ctx.scale(pulse, pulse);\n212\t      ctx.translate(-screenW / 2, -(claimBtnY + 16));\n213\t      ctx.fillStyle = '#FF4D4D';\n214\t      this._roundRect(ctx, screenW / 2 - 70, claimBtnY, 140, 32, 16);\n215\t      ctx.fill();\n216\t      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n217\t      ctx.font = 'bold 14px sans-serif';\n218\t      ctx.fillText(`领取 ${this.getLoginReward()}🪙`, screenW / 2, claimBtnY + 22);\n219\t      ctx.restore();\n220\t    } else {\n221\t      ctx.fillStyle = '#8D6E63';\n222\t      ctx.font = '14px sans-serif';\n223\t      ctx.fillText('今日已领取 ✓', screenW / 2, claimBtnY + 20);\n224\t    }\n225\t\n226\t    // Daily tasks\n227\t    const taskStartY = claimBtnY + 50;\n228\t    ctx.fillStyle = '#5D4037';\n229\t    ctx.font = 'bold 16px sans-serif';\n230\t    ctx.fillText('今日任务', screenW / 2, taskStartY);\n231\t\n232\t    const tasks = this.getTasks();\n233\t    const taskH = 58;\n234\t    for (let i = 0; i < tasks.length; i++) {\n235\t      const t = tasks[i];\n236\t      const ty = taskStartY + 14 + i * (taskH + 6);\n237\t      const tw = screenW - 40;\n238\t      const tx = 20;\n239\t\n240\t      ctx.fillStyle = t.claimed ? '#F5F5F5' : '#FFFFFFEE';\n241\t      this._roundRect(ctx, tx, ty, tw, taskH, 10);\n242\t      ctx.fill();\n243\t\n244\t      if (t.completed && !t.claimed) {\n245\t        ctx.strokeStyle = '#FFB800';\n246\t        ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n247\t        this._roundRect(ctx, tx, ty, tw, taskH, 10);\n248\t        ctx.stroke();\n249\t      }\n250\t\n251\t      ctx.textAlign = 'left';\n252\t      ctx.fillStyle = t.claimed ? '#B0A898' : '#5D4037';\n253\t      ctx.font = 'bold 13px sans-serif';\n254\t      ctx.fillText(t.name, tx + 12, ty + 20);\n255\t\n256\t      ctx.font = '11px sans-serif';\n257\t      ctx.fillStyle = '#8D6E63';\n258\t      ctx.fillText(t.desc, tx + 12, ty + 36);\n259\t\n260\t      // Progress bar\n261\t      const pbX = tx + 12;\n262\t      const pbY = ty + 42;\n263\t      const pbW = tw - 100;\n264\t      const pbH = 8;\n265\t      ctx.fillStyle = '#E8E0D8';\n266\t      this._roundRect(ctx, pbX, pbY, pbW, pbH, 4);\n267\t      ctx.fill();\n268\t      const progress = Math.min(t.progress / t.target, 1);\n269\t      ctx.fillStyle = t.completed ? '#6BCB77' : '#4DA6FF';\n270\t      this._roundRect(ctx, pbX, pbY, Math.max(pbW * progress, 4), pbH, 4);\n271\t      ctx.fill();\n272\t\n273\t      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n274\t      ctx.fillStyle = '#8D6E63';\n275\t      ctx.font = '10px sans-serif';\n276\t      ctx.fillText(`${Math.min(t.progress, t.target)}/${t.target}`, pbX + pbW / 2, pbY + 7);\n277\t\n278\t      // Reward / claim button\n279\t      const rbX = tx + tw - 80;\n280\t      if (t.completed && !t.claimed) {\n281\t        ctx.fillStyle = '#FFB800';\n282\t        this._roundRect(ctx, rbX, ty + 10, 68, 28, 14);\n283\t        ctx.fill();\n284\t        ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n285\t        ctx.font = 'bold 12px sans-serif';\n286\t        ctx.fillText(`领${t.reward}🪙`, rbX + 34, ty + 29);\n287\t      } else if (t.claimed) {\n288\t        ctx.fillStyle = '#B0A898';\n289\t        ctx.font = '12px sans-serif';\n290\t        ctx.fillText('已领 ✓', rbX + 34, ty + 28);\n291\t      } else {\n292\t        ctx.fillStyle = '#8D6E63';\n293\t        ctx.font = 'bold 12px sans-serif';\n294\t        ctx.fillText(`${t.reward}🪙`, rbX + 34, ty + 28);\n295\t      }\n296\t    }\n297\t\n298\t    // Daily challenge\n299\t    const chalY = taskStartY + 14 + tasks.length * (taskH + 6) + 10;\n300\t    ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n301\t    ctx.fillStyle = '#5D4037';\n302\t    ctx.font = 'bold 16px sans-serif';\n303\t    ctx.fillText('🏆 每日挑战', screenW / 2, chalY);\n304\t\n305\t    const chalBoxY = chalY + 10;\n306\t    ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF8E7';\n307\t    this._roundRect(ctx, 20, chalBoxY, screenW - 40, 50, 10);\n308\t    ctx.fill();\n309\t    ctx.strokeStyle = '#FF9A3C';\n310\t    ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n311\t    this._roundRect(ctx, 20, chalBoxY, screenW - 40, 50, 10);\n312\t    ctx.stroke();\n313\t\n314\t    ctx.fillStyle = '#5D4037';\n315\t    ctx.font = 'bold 13px sans-serif';\n316\t    ctx.fillText(`挑战关卡 ${this.daily.challengeLevel + 1}`, screenW / 2, chalBoxY + 20);\n317\t    ctx.font = '11px sans-serif';\n318\t    ctx.fillStyle = '#8D6E63';\n319\t    ctx.fillText('完成获得 50🪙 + 荣誉', screenW / 2, chalBoxY + 38);\n320\t\n321\t    if (this.daily.challengeCompleted) {\n322\t      ctx.fillStyle = '#6BCB77';\n323\t      ctx.font = 'bold 12px sans-serif';\n324\t      ctx.fillText('已完成 ✓', screenW / 2, chalBoxY + 38);\n325\t    }\n326\t\n327\t    // Back button\n328\t    ctx.fillStyle = '#8D6E63';\n329\t    this._roundRect(ctx, 20, screenH - 50, screenW - 40, 38, 19);\n330\t    ctx.fill();\n331\t    ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n332\t    ctx.font = 'bold 14px sans-serif';\n333\t    ctx.fillText('返回地图', screenW / 2, screenH - 27);\n334\t  }\n335\t\n336\t  handleClick(x, y, screenW, screenH) {\n337\t    this.checkNewDay();\n338\t\n339\t    // Login claim button\n340\t    const claimBtnY = 70 + 40 + 30;\n341\t    if (!this.daily.todayClaimed) {\n342\t      if (x >= screenW / 2 - 70 && x <= screenW / 2 + 70 && y >= claimBtnY && y <= claimBtnY + 32) {\n343\t        const reward = this.claimLoginReward();\n344\t        if (reward > 0) return { action: 'claim_login', reward };\n345\t      }\n346\t    }\n347\t\n348\t    // Task claim buttons\n349\t    const tasks = this.getTasks();\n350\t    const taskStartY = claimBtnY + 50;\n351\t    const taskH = 58;\n352\t    for (let i = 0; i < tasks.length; i++) {\n353\t      const t = tasks[i];\n354\t      if (t.completed && !t.claimed) {\n355\t        const ty = taskStartY + 14 + i * (taskH + 6);\n356\t        const rbX = screenW - 40 - 80 + 20;\n357\t        if (x >= rbX && x <= rbX + 68 && y >= ty + 10 && y <= ty + 38) {\n358\t          const reward = this.claimTaskReward(t.id);\n359\t          if (reward > 0) return { action: 'claim_task', taskId: t.id, reward };\n360\t        }\n361\t      }\n362\t    }\n363\t\n364\t    // Challenge click\n365\t    const chalY = taskStartY + 14 + tasks.length * (taskH + 6) + 10;\n366\t    const chalBoxY = chalY + 10;\n367\t    if (x >= 20 && x <= screenW - 20 && y >= chalBoxY && y <= chalBoxY + 50) {\n368\t      if (!this.daily.challengeCompleted) {\n369\t        return { action: 'play_challenge', level: this.daily.challengeLevel };\n370\t      }\n371\t    }\n372\t\n373\t    // Back button\n374\t    if (y >= screenH - 50 && y <= screenH - 12 && x >= 20 && x <= screenW - 20) {\n375\t      return { action: 'back' };\n376\t    }\n377\t\n378\t    return null;\n379\t  }\n380\t\n381\t  _roundRect(ctx, x, y, w, h, r) {\n382\t    ctx.beginPath();\n383\t    ctx.moveTo(x + r, y);\n384\t    ctx.lineTo(x + w - r, y);\n385\t    ctx.quadraticCurveTo(x + w, y, x + w, y + r);\n386\t    ctx.lineTo(x + w, y + h - r);\n387\t    ctx.quadraticCurveTo(x + w, y + h, x + w - r, y + h);\n388\t    ctx.lineTo(x + r, y + h);\n389\t    ctx.quadraticCurveTo(x, y + h, x, y + h - r);\n390\t    ctx.lineTo(x, y + r);\n391\t    ctx.quadraticCurveTo(x, y, x + r, y);\n392\t    ctx.closePath();\n393\t  }\n394\t}\n395\t\n396\tif (typeof module !== 'undefined') module.exports = { DailySystem };\n397\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"efc4c585-24c5-4fd5-bbba-79c262b1755c","uuid":"609d9a31-80fc-445c-b74c-5c4b1ed8885c","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:32:21.780Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\game-projects\\douyin-match3\\src\\js\\DailySystem.js","content":"// DailySystem.js — Daily login rewards, daily tasks, daily challenge\n\nclass DailySystem {\n  constructor(dataManager, coinSystem) {\n    this.dm = dataManager;\n    this.cs = coinSystem;\n    this.LOGIN_REWARDS = [10, 20, 40, 80, 150, 300, 500];\n    this.TASK_TEMPLATES = [\n      { id: 'clear_ice', name: '消除冰块达人', desc: '消除 {n} 个冰块', type: 'clear_obstacle', subType: 1, targets: [5, 8, 10] },\n      { id: 'clear_chain', name: '破链专家', desc: '消除 {n} 个锁链', type: 'clear_obstacle', subType: 2, targets: [4, 6, 8] },\n      { id: 'score_high', name: '高分挑战', desc: '单局获得 {n} 分', type: 'score', targets: [2000, 3000, 4000] },\n      { id: 'chain_3', name: '连锁之王', desc: '达成 {n} 次连锁', type: 'chain', targets: [3, 5, 8] },\n      { id: 'play_levels', name: '闯关达人', desc: '完成 {n} 关', type: 'complete_levels', targets: [2, 3, 5] },\n      { id: 'star_3', name: '完美三星', desc: '获得 {n} 次三星', type: 'star3', targets: [1, 2, 3] },\n      { id: 'use_special', name: '特效大师', desc: '使用 {n} 次特殊方块', type: 'special', targets: [3, 5, 8] },\n      { id: 'collect_color', name: '色彩收集者', desc: '收集 {n} 个同色方块', type: 'collect_single', targets: [20, 30, 40] },\n    ];\n    this._initDaily();\n  }\n\n  _initDaily() {\n    if (!this.dm.data.daily) {\n      this.dm.data.daily = {\n        loginDay: 0,\n        lastLoginDate: null,\n        todayClaimed: false,\n        tasks: [],\n        challengeLevel: -1,\n        challengeCompleted: false,\n        taskProgress: {},\n        weekStart: null,\n      };\n      this.dm.save();\n    }\n    this.daily = this.dm.data.daily;\n  }\n\n  _todayStr() {\n    return new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n  }\n\n  _isSameDay(d1, d2) {\n    if (!d1 || !d2) return false;\n    return d1.slice(0, 10) === d2.slice(0, 10);\n  }\n\n  checkNewDay() {\n    const today = this._todayStr();\n    if (!this._isSameDay(this.daily.lastLoginDate, today)) {\n      const lastDate = this.daily.lastLoginDate ? new Date(this.daily.lastLoginDate) : null;\n      const todayDate = new Date(today);\n      const diffDays = lastDate ? Math.floor((todayDate - lastDate) / 86400000) : 99;\n\n      if (diffDays === 1) {\n        this.daily.loginDay = Math.min(this.daily.loginDay + 1, 6);\n      } else if (diffDays > 1) {\n        this.daily.loginDay = 0;\n      }\n\n      this.daily.todayClaimed = false;\n      this.daily.lastLoginDate = today;\n      this.daily.challengeCompleted = false;\n      this._generateTasks();\n      this._generateChallenge();\n      this.dm.save();\n    }\n  }\n\n  claimLoginReward() {\n    if (this.daily.todayClaimed) return 0;\n    this.daily.todayClaimed = true;\n    const reward = this.LOGIN_REWARDS[this.daily.loginDay] || 10;\n    this.dm.addCoins(reward);\n    this.dm.save();\n    return reward;\n  }\n\n  getLoginDay() { return this.daily.loginDay; }\n  getLoginReward() { return this.LOGIN_REWARDS[this.daily.loginDay] || 10; }\n  isLoginClaimed() { return this.daily.todayClaimed; }\n\n  _generateTasks() {\n    const shuffled = [...this.TASK_TEMPLATES].sort(() => Math.random() - 0.5);\n    const selected = shuffled.slice(0, 3);\n    this.daily.tasks = selected.map((t, i) => {\n      const diff = Math.min(i, t.targets.length - 1);\n      return {\n        id: t.id + '_' + i,\n        templateId: t.id,\n        name: t.name,\n        desc: t.desc.replace('{n}', t.targets[diff]),\n        type: t.type,\n        subType: t.subType || 0,\n        target: t.targets[diff],\n        reward: [20, 50, 100][i],\n        progress: 0,\n        completed: false,\n        claimed: false,\n      };\n    });\n    this.daily.taskProgress = {};\n    this.dm.save();\n  }\n\n  getTasks() { return this.daily.tasks || []; }\n\n  reportEvent(eventType, value) {\n    for (const task of this.daily.tasks) {\n      if (task.completed) continue;\n      if (task.type === eventType) {\n        task.progress = Math.min(task.progress + (value || 1), task.target);\n        if (task.progress >= task.target) task.completed = true;\n      }\n      if (task.type === 'clear_obstacle' && eventType === 'clear_obstacle') {\n        if (task.subType === 0 || task.subType === value) {\n          task.progress = Math.min(task.progress + 1, task.target);\n          if (task.progress >= task.target) task.completed = true;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    this.dm.save();\n  }\n\n  claimTaskReward(taskId) {\n    const task = this.daily.tasks.find(t => t.id === taskId);\n    if (!task || !task.completed || task.claimed) return 0;\n    task.claimed = true;\n    this.dm.addCoins(task.reward);\n    this.dm.save();\n    return task.reward;\n  }\n\n  _generateChallenge() {\n    const dayOfWeek = new Date().getDay();\n    const seed = Math.floor(Date.now() / 86400000);\n    const levelPool = [];\n    for (let i = 5; i < 50; i++) levelPool.push(i);\n    const idx = (seed * 7 + dayOfWeek * 13) % levelPool.length;\n    this.daily.challengeLevel = levelPool[idx];\n    this.daily.challengeCompleted = false;\n    this.dm.save();\n  }\n\n  getChallengeLevel() { return this.daily.challengeLevel; }\n  isChallengeDone() { return this.daily.challengeCompleted; }\n  completeChallenge() {\n    if (this.daily.challengeCompleted) return 0;\n    this.daily.challengeCompleted = true;\n    this.dm.addCoins(50);\n    this.dm.save();\n    return 50;\n  }\n\n  render(ctx, screenW, screenH) {\n    this.checkNewDay();\n    const grad = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, 0, 0, screenH);\n    grad.addColorStop(0, '#FFF8E7');\n    grad.addColorStop(0.5, '#E8F5E9');\n    grad.addColorStop(1, '#E3F2FD');\n    ctx.fillStyle = grad;\n    ctx.fillRect(0, 0, screenW, screenH);\n\n    // Title bar\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#FF9A3C';\n    this._roundRect(ctx, 10, 8, screenW - 20, 48, 12);\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n    ctx.font = 'bold 20px sans-serif';\n    ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n    ctx.fillText('📅 每日任务', screenW / 2, 40);\n\n    // Login reward section\n    const loginY = 70;\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#5D4037';\n    ctx.font = 'bold 16px sans-serif';\n    ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n    ctx.fillText(`连续登录第 ${this.daily.loginDay + 1} 天`, screenW / 2, loginY);\n\n    // 7-day login boxes\n    const boxSize = Math.min(40, (screenW - 60) / 7);\n    const boxStartX = (screenW - boxSize * 7 - 6 * 4) / 2;\n    for (let i = 0; i < 7; i++) {\n      const bx = boxStartX + i * (boxSize + 4);\n      const by = loginY + 10;\n      const isCurrent = i === this.daily.loginDay;\n      const isPast = i < this.daily.loginDay;\n\n      ctx.fillStyle = isCurrent ? '#FFB800' : isPast ? '#6BCB77' : '#E8E0D8';\n      this._roundRect(ctx, bx, by, boxSize, boxSize + 8, 6);\n      ctx.fill();\n\n      ctx.fillStyle = isPast || isCurrent ? '#FFF' : '#A09888';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 11px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText(`D${i + 1}`, bx + boxSize / 2, by + 14);\n      ctx.font = '10px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText(`${this.LOGIN_REWARDS[i]}🪙`, bx + boxSize / 2, by + 30);\n\n      if (isCurrent && !this.daily.todayClaimed) {\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#FF4D4D';\n        ctx.font = 'bold 10px sans-serif';\n        ctx.fillText('领取', bx + boxSize / 2, by + boxSize + 2);\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Claim button\n    const claimBtnY = loginY + boxSize + 30;\n    if (!this.daily.todayClaimed) {\n      const pulse = 1 + Math.sin(Date.now() / 300) * 0.05;\n      ctx.save();\n      ctx.translate(screenW / 2, claimBtnY + 16);\n      ctx.scale(pulse, pulse);\n      ctx.translate(-screenW / 2, -(claimBtnY + 16));\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FF4D4D';\n      this._roundRect(ctx, screenW / 2 - 70, claimBtnY, 140, 32, 16);\n      ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 14px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText(`领取 ${this.getLoginReward()}🪙`, screenW / 2, claimBtnY + 22);\n      ctx.restore();\n    } else {\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#8D6E63';\n      ctx.font = '14px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('今日已领取 ✓', screenW / 2, claimBtnY + 20);\n    }\n\n    // Daily tasks\n    const taskStartY = claimBtnY + 50;\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#5D4037';\n    ctx.font = 'bold 16px sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillText('今日任务', screenW / 2, taskStartY);\n\n    const tasks = this.getTasks();\n    const taskH = 58;\n    for (let i = 0; i < tasks.length; i++) {\n      const t = tasks[i];\n      const ty = taskStartY + 14 + i * (taskH + 6);\n      const tw = screenW - 40;\n      const tx = 20;\n\n      ctx.fillStyle = t.claimed ? '#F5F5F5' : '#FFFFFFEE';\n      this._roundRect(ctx, tx, ty, tw, taskH, 10);\n      ctx.fill();\n\n      if (t.completed && !t.claimed) {\n        ctx.strokeStyle = '#FFB800';\n        ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n        this._roundRect(ctx, tx, ty, tw, taskH, 10);\n        ctx.stroke();\n      }\n\n      ctx.textAlign = 'left';\n      ctx.fillStyle = t.claimed ? '#B0A898' : '#5D4037';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 13px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText(t.name, tx + 12, ty + 20);\n\n      ctx.font = '11px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#8D6E63';\n      ctx.fillText(t.desc, tx + 12, ty + 36);\n\n      // Progress bar\n      const pbX = tx + 12;\n      const pbY = ty + 42;\n      const pbW = tw - 100;\n      const pbH = 8;\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#E8E0D8';\n      this._roundRect(ctx, pbX, pbY, pbW, pbH, 4);\n      ctx.fill();\n      const progress = Math.min(t.progress / t.target, 1);\n      ctx.fillStyle = t.completed ? '#6BCB77' : '#4DA6FF';\n      this._roundRect(ctx, pbX, pbY, Math.max(pbW * progress, 4), pbH, 4);\n      ctx.fill();\n\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#8D6E63';\n      ctx.font = '10px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText(`${Math.min(t.progress, t.target)}/${t.target}`, pbX + pbW / 2, pbY + 7);\n\n      // Reward / claim button\n      const rbX = tx + tw - 80;\n      if (t.completed && !t.claimed) {\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#FFB800';\n        this._roundRect(ctx, rbX, ty + 10, 68, 28, 14);\n        ctx.fill();\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n        ctx.font = 'bold 12px sans-serif';\n        ctx.fillText(`领${t.reward}🪙`, rbX + 34, ty + 29);\n      } else if (t.claimed) {\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#B0A898';\n        ctx.font = '12px sans-serif';\n        ctx.fillText('已领 ✓', rbX + 34, ty + 28);\n      } else {\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#8D6E63';\n        ctx.font = 'bold 12px sans-serif';\n        ctx.fillText(`${t.reward}🪙`, rbX + 34, ty + 28);\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Daily challenge\n    const chalY = taskStartY + 14 + tasks.length * (taskH + 6) + 10;\n    ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#5D4037';\n    ctx.font = 'bold 16px sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillText('🏆 每日挑战', screenW / 2, chalY);\n\n    const chalBoxY = chalY + 10;\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF8E7';\n    this._roundRect(ctx, 20, chalBoxY, screenW - 40, 50, 10);\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#FF9A3C';\n    ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n    this._roundRect(ctx, 20, chalBoxY, screenW - 40, 50, 10);\n    ctx.stroke();\n\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#5D4037';\n    ctx.font = 'bold 13px sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillText(`挑战关卡 ${this.daily.challengeLevel + 1}`, screenW / 2, chalBoxY + 20);\n    ctx.font = '11px sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#8D6E63';\n    ctx.fillText('完成获得 50🪙 + 荣誉', screenW / 2, chalBoxY + 38);\n\n    if (this.daily.challengeCompleted) {\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#6BCB77';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 12px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('已完成 ✓', screenW / 2, chalBoxY + 38);\n    }\n\n    // Back button\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#8D6E63';\n    this._roundRect(ctx, 20, screenH - 50, screenW - 40, 38, 19);\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n    ctx.font = 'bold 14px sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillText('返回地图', screenW / 2, screenH - 27);\n  }\n\n  handleClick(x, y, screenW, screenH) {\n    this.checkNewDay();\n\n    // Login claim button\n    const claimBtnY = 70 + 40 + 30;\n    if (!this.daily.todayClaimed) {\n      if (x >= screenW / 2 - 70 && x <= screenW / 2 + 70 && y >= claimBtnY && y <= claimBtnY + 32) {\n        const reward = this.claimLoginReward();\n        if (reward > 0) return { action: 'claim_login', reward };\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Task claim buttons\n    const tasks = this.getTasks();\n    const taskStartY = claimBtnY + 50;\n    const taskH = 58;\n    for (let i = 0; i < tasks.length; i++) {\n      const t = tasks[i];\n      if (t.completed && !t.claimed) {\n        const ty = taskStartY + 14 + i * (taskH + 6);\n        const rbX = screenW - 40 - 80 + 20;\n        if (x >= rbX && x <= rbX + 68 && y >= ty + 10 && y <= ty + 38) {\n          const reward = this.claimTaskReward(t.id);\n          if (reward > 0) return { action: 'claim_task', taskId: t.id, reward };\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Challenge click\n    const chalY = taskStartY + 14 + tasks.length * (taskH + 6) + 10;\n    const chalBoxY = chalY + 10;\n    if (x >= 20 && x <= screenW - 20 && y >= chalBoxY && y <= chalBoxY + 50) {\n      if (!this.daily.challengeCompleted) {\n        return { action: 'play_challenge', level: this.daily.challengeLevel };\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Back button\n    if (y >= screenH - 50 && y <= screenH - 12 && x >= 20 && x <= screenW - 20) {\n      return { action: 'back' };\n    }\n\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  _roundRect(ctx, x, y, w, h, r) {\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.moveTo(x + r, y);\n    ctx.lineTo(x + w - r, y);\n    ctx.quadraticCurveTo(x + w, y, x + w, y + r);\n    ctx.lineTo(x + w, y + h - r);\n    ctx.quadraticCurveTo(x + w, y + h, x + w - r, y + h);\n    ctx.lineTo(x + r, y + h);\n    ctx.quadraticCurveTo(x, y + h, x, y + h - r);\n    ctx.lineTo(x, y + r);\n    ctx.quadraticCurveTo(x, y, x + r, y);\n    ctx.closePath();\n  }\n}\n\nif (typeof module !== 'undefined') module.exports = { DailySystem };\n","numLines":397,"startLine":1,"totalLines":397}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_2026052306322406d4bf136c0c4984","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me analyze the 3 P0 bugs:\n\n**Bug 1: DailySystem任务双倍计数**\nLooking at `reportEvent` method (lines 107-122):\n```javascript\nreportEvent(eventType, value) {\n    for (const task of this.daily.tasks) {\n      if (task.completed) continue;\n      if (task.type === eventType) {\n        task.progress = Math.min(task.progress + (value || 1), task.target);\n        if (task.progress >= task.target) task.completed = true;\n      }\n      if (task.type === 'clear_obstacle' && eventType === 'clear_obstacle') {\n        if (task.subType === 0 || task.subType === value) {\n          task.progress = Math.min(task.progress + 1, task.target);\n          if (task.progress >= task.target) task.completed = true;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    this.dm.save();\n  }\n```\n\nThe problem: When `eventType` is `'clear_obstacle'` and `task.type` is `'clear_obstacle'`, the first `if` block increments progress (line 111), then the second `if` block ALSO increments it (line 116). So progress gets doubled for clear_obstacle tasks.\n\nFix: Use `else if` instead of the second independent `if`, or add a flag to prevent double-counting. Actually, looking more carefully:\n- First `if (task.type === eventType)` — this matches for any clear_obstacle task when eventType is 'clear_obstacle'. It increments by `value || 1`.\n- Second `if (task.type === 'clear_obstacle' && eventType === 'clear_obstacle')` — this also matches and increments by 1.\n\nFor clear_obstacle events, both conditions are true, so progress gets incremented twice. The fix should use `else if` for the second condition, or better yet, restructure the logic so clear_obstacle is only handled once.\n\nThe proper fix: The first `if` handles generic type matching, the second `if` handles clear_obstacle with subType filtering. The second block should be an `else if` that handles the clear_obstacle case specifically, while the first block should skip clear_obstacle tasks (since they're handled by the second block). Or, we can combine them.\n\nActually, the cleanest fix is to make the second `if` an `else if` so clear_obstacle events only match one path:\n```javascript\nreportEvent(eventType, value) {\n    for (const task of this.daily.tasks) {\n      if (task.completed) continue;\n      if (task.type === 'clear_obstacle' && eventType === 'clear_obstacle') {\n        if (task.subType === 0 || task.subType === value) {\n          task.progress = Math.min(task.progress + 1, task.target);\n          if (task.progress >= task.target) task.completed = true;\n        }\n      } else if (task.type === eventType) {\n        task.progress = Math.min(task.progress + (value || 1), task.target);\n        if (task.progress >= task.target) task.completed = true;\n      }\n    }\n    this.dm.save();\n  }\n```\n\n**Bug 2: Board.shuffle null崩溃**\nLooking at `shuffle` method (lines 260-284):\n```javascript\nshuffle() {\n    const tiles = [];\n    for (let r = 0; r < this.size; r++) {\n      for (let c = 0; c < this.size; c++) {\n        tiles.push(this.grid[r][c].color);  // NULL REFERENCE HERE!\n      }\n    }\n```\n\nIf any cell in the grid is null (after gravity/clearing), `this.grid[r][c].color` will throw a null reference error.\n\nFix: Check for null and skip or assign a default color.\n\n**Bug 3: ScoreSystem步数边界**\nLooking at `isGameOver`:\n```javascript\nisGameOver() {\n    return this.getRemainingMoves() <= 0 && !this.isGoalComplete();\n}\n```\n\nAnd `useMove`:\n```javascript\nuseMove() {\n    this.moves++;\n    if (this.onMovesChange) this.onMovesChange(this.getRemainingMoves());\n    return this.getRemainingMoves() >= 0;\n}\n```\n\nThe issue: `useMove()` returns false when `getRemainingMoves() < 0` (i.e., `moves > maxMoves`). But in `isGameOver`, `getRemainingMoves() <= 0` means it triggers when `moves >= maxMoves`, i.e., when remaining moves is exactly 0. This is a boundary issue: the player should be able to use the last move (remaining = 0) and then the game checks if the goal is met. But `isGameOver()` returns true when remaining = 0 AND goal isn't complete.\n\nWait, let me think again. If `maxMoves = 30`:\n- After 29 moves: remaining = 1\n- After 30 moves: remaining = 0\n\n`isGameOver` triggers at remaining <= 0, which means after using all 30 moves. That seems correct... Actually, the issue might be different. Let me re-read.\n\n`useMove()` returns `this.getRemainingMoves() >= 0`. So after the 30th move, remaining = 0, and it returns true (move was valid). Then `isGameOver()` checks remaining <= 0, which is true. If goal not complete, game over. This seems correct.\n\nHmm, but the bug might be that after the last move triggers a match, the cascade might provide additional points that complete the goal. But `isGameOver()` is called after `useMove()` and before the cascade resolves. Actually, I think the real boundary issue might be:\n1. `useMove()` allows a move when remaining = 0 (the 30th move with maxMoves=30), because `0 >= 0` is true. But after incrementing, remaining becomes -1... wait, no. After the 30th move, `moves = 30`, so `maxMoves - moves = 30 - 30 = 0`. So remaining is 0, which is `>= 0`, so the move is allowed.\n\nActually, let me look more carefully. The flow would be:\n1. Before move: `moves = 29`, remaining = 1\n2. `useMove()`: moves becomes 30, remaining = 0, returns true (valid move)\n3. After processing matches, `checkState()` is called\n4. `isGameOver()` checks `remaining <= 0` which is `0 <= 0` = true\n5. If goal not complete, game is over\n\nThis seems correct. But what about:\n1. Before move: `moves = 30`, remaining = 0\n2. `useMove()`: moves becomes 31, remaining = -1, returns false (invalid move)\n\nThe issue is that the player should be able to make their 30th move (the last one). So `useMove` should be called when remaining > 0, and after the move, remaining = maxMoves - moves.\n\nWait, actually the issue might be that the game calls `useMove()` when remaining is already 0 (no moves left), and `useMove()` returns false, but the code still processes the swap. Or the issue might be that `checkState()` is called right after `useMove()` before the cascade finishes, so the game ends prematurely.\n\nLet me reconsider. The boundary issue is probably:\n- When `remainingMoves() === 0`, `isGameOver()` returns true even if there's still a cascade/chain happening that could complete the goal.\n\nThe fix should be: `isGameOver()` should only trigger when `getRemainingMoves() < 0`, not `<= 0`. Because remaining = 0 means the player just used their last move, and cascades should still resolve.\n\nActually wait. If `maxMoves = 30` and player uses 30 moves, then `remaining = 0`. `useMove()` returns `remaining >= 0` which is `0 >= 0 = true`. Then `isGameOver()` checks `remaining <= 0` which is `0 <= 0 = true`. So after the last valid move, the game immediately says \"game over\" before even processing the matches from that move!\n\nThat's the bug. The fix: change `isGameOver` to check `< 0` instead of `<= 0`, so the last move has a chance to resolve.\n\nActually, let me reconsider once more. The flow would be:\n1. Player swaps tiles (move 30)\n2. `useMove()` called, moves = 30, remaining = 0, returns true\n3. Matches are found, cascades happen\n4. After all cascades, `checkState()` is called\n5. `isGoalComplete()` - if goal met, level complete\n6. `isGameOver()` - remaining = 0, goal not met, returns true → game over\n\nStep 6 would be correct - the player used all 30 moves and didn't reach the goal. So remaining = 0 and game over is correct.\n\nBut what if:\n1. Player has remaining = 1 (29 moves used)\n2. Player swaps, `useMove()` called, moves = 30, remaining = 0\n3. Match resolves, cascade happens, chain reactions occur\n4. During the chain, more score is earned\n5. After chain, `checkState()` - isGoalComplete? Maybe yes, maybe no.\n6. If not complete, isGameOver? remaining = 0, so yes.\n\nThis is actually correct behavior. After using all moves, if goal isn't met, game over.\n\nHmm, but the bug report says \"步数边界\" which suggests there IS a boundary issue. Let me think about this differently...\n\nPerhaps the issue is that `useMove()` returns true when remaining = 0 (allowing the 30th move), but the caller might check `useMove()` AFTER the swap is already made. If the game flow is:\n1. Player swaps tiles\n2. Match detection runs\n3. THEN `useMove()` is called\n\nThen by step 3, the matches have already been processed. If `useMove()` returns false (no moves left), the game should end. But if the matches in step 2 completed the goal, the game should show \"level complete\" instead.\n\nThe real issue might be that `checkState()` is called too early, or the order of operations is wrong. Let me check how the game loop uses these...\n\nActually, I don't have the game loop code. Let me focus on what's clearly wrong:\n\nLooking at `useMove()`:\n```javascript\nuseMove() {\n    this.moves++;\n    if (this.onMovesChange) this.onMovesChange(this.getRemainingMoves());\n    return this.getRemainingMoves() >= 0;\n}\n```\n\nAfter `maxMoves` moves, remaining = 0, return true. After `maxMoves + 1` moves, remaining = -1, return false.\n\nThe boundary issue: when remaining = 0, the game should still check if the goal is complete from the LAST move. But `isGameOver()` with `<= 0` would return true immediately after the last move resolves.\n\nActually, I think the real fix is simpler. The `isGameOver` should not trigger when `remainingMoves() === 0` IF there's still a chain in progress. But since we don't track that here, the simpler fix is:\n\nChange `isGameOver` from `<= 0` to `< 0`. This means:\n- remaining = 0: game is NOT over yet (last move just happened, cascades might still be resolving)\n- remaining = -1: game IS over\n\nWait, but this means the game would never end after using all moves... unless something else decrements moves.\n\nOK, I think the actual boundary issue is probably that after `useMove()`, if remaining = 0, the game immediately ends without giving the cascades a chance. The fix should be to check `< 0` instead of `<= 0` in `isGameOver()`. The game caller should check `useMove()` return value to prevent additional moves when remaining is 0.\n\nActually let me just look at the game loop to be sure.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"efc4c585-24c5-4fd5-bbba-79c262b1755c","uuid":"673818d5-7cc8-434d-a14a-c4af19f28744"}
